---
/**
 * Loads src/scripts/motion.ts. Rendered once, unconditionally, by Layout.
 *
 * It is its own component on purpose. As a plain <script> in Layout.astro,
 * next to Layout's conditional TOC script ({hasHeadings && <script>}), the
 * production build (Astro 5.15) shipped it only on article pages and shipped
 * the TOC script on pages without headings instead - the dev server rendered
 * both correctly, so nothing looked wrong until dist/ was inspected. Here it is
 * the only script in a component that always renders, which the build handles.
 */
---

<script>
  import '../scripts/motion';
</script>
